LAMMPS (22 Jul 2025 - Update 4)
# HnsCub-like: a FENE chain and crowders in a periodic cube;
# thermo_style custom with compute, vector and variable keywords.
# Runs: 0 equilibration; 1 neighbour checks off ("Dangerous builds not
# checked"); 2 stopped early by fix halt (error continue), whose message
# line sits in the table; 3 production.

units           lj
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      bond

variable        randseed equal 3301
region          box block -8 8 -8 8 -12 12 units box
create_box      2 box bond/types 1 extra/bond/per/atom 2 extra/special/per/atom 6
Created orthogonal box = (-8 -8 -12) to (8 8 12)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
molecule        chain chain20.mol
Read molecule template chain:
# linear chain of 20 beads along z, bond length 0.97
  1 molecules
  0 fragments
  0 bodies
  20 atoms with max type 1
  19 bonds with max type 1
  0 angles with max type 0
  0 dihedrals with max type 0
  0 impropers with max type 0
create_atoms    0 single 0.0 0.0 0.0 mol chain 1234 rotate 0 0 0 1 units box
Created 20 atoms
  using box units in orthogonal box = (-8 -8 -12) to (8 8 12)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.000 seconds
create_atoms    2 random 300 ${randseed} box overlap 1.0 maxtry 100 units box
create_atoms    2 random 300 3301 box overlap 1.0 maxtry 100 units box
Created 300 atoms
  using box units in orthogonal box = (-8 -8 -12) to (8 8 12)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.001 seconds
mass            * 1.0
group           bug type 1
20 atoms in group bug
group           crowd type 2
300 atoms in group crowd

pair_style      lj/cut 1.122462
pair_modify     shift yes
pair_coeff      * * 1.0 1.0 1.122462
bond_style      fene
bond_coeff      1 30.0 1.5 1.0 1.0
special_bonds   fene
Finding 1-2 1-3 1-4 neighbors ...
  special bond factors lj:    0        1        1       
  special bond factors coul:  0        1        1       
     2 = max # of 1-2 neighbors
    13 = max # of special neighbors
  special bonds CPU = 0.000 seconds
neighbor        0.3 bin
neigh_modify    delay 0 every 1 check yes

compute         rg bug gyration
variable        rg2 equal c_rg^2
variable        s equal step

velocity        all create 1.0 ${randseed}
velocity        all create 1.0 3301
fix             F_langevin all langevin 1.0 1.0 1.0 ${randseed} tally yes
fix             F_langevin all langevin 1.0 1.0 1.0 3301 tally yes
fix             F_nve all nve/limit 0.01
thermo          100
thermo_style    custom step ke pe etail ecouple econserve evdwl ebond                 c_rg c_rg[1] c_rg[3] v_rg2
thermo_modify   flush yes norm no
timestep        0.005
run             500
Generated 0 of 1 mixed pair_coeff terms from geometric mixing rule
